<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico drains 151 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico drains 151 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico drained 151 million pesos from the secondary market on Tuesday through one single repurchase agreement, dealers said.</p>
<p>The terms and maturities of the repurchase agreement were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	 AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    151 million    1 day	17.24 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
